1	/**
2	 * local-docker profile factory (T5 — standalone-executor-hardening).
3	 *
4	 * Bundles the decoupled adapter set into a RuntimePorts instance for the
5	 * M:N multi-container topology: the orchestrator enqueues a credential-free
6	 * DispatchJob to a Redis Stream; the dispatcher service (T4) consumes, injects
7	 * credentials, and spawns executor containers.
8	 *
9	 * The orchestrator is unprivileged on this path — no Docker socket, no
10	 * credential resolution, no docker run.
11	 *
12	 * Adapter set:
13	 *   ExecutorPort         → QueueDispatchAdapter  (XADD to dispatch Redis Stream)
14	 *   CompletionBrokerPort → HttpBrokerAdapter     (calls Go broker service at BROKER_URL)
15	 *   WorkflowState        → GitWorkflowStateAdapter
